{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00598","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享龙池乐章 第九章 · 姜皎","name":"郊庙歌辞 享龙池乐章 第九章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵沼萦回邸第前，浴日涵天写曙天。\n始见龙台昇凤阙，应如霄汉起神泉。\n石匮渚傍还啓圣，桃李初生更有仙。\n欲化帝图从此受，正同河变一千年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姜皎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00598.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00598","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}